<title>SPAIN: Buba's Schieber -euro not to boost jobs short-term.</title>
<headline>Buba's Schieber -euro not to boost jobs short-term.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Helmut Schieber said on Monday Europe's single currency would only reduce unemployment in the long-term and not at the beginning.</p>
<p>&quot;The euro initially will not be very helpful for jobs because it will create more competition and higher productivity and this will reduce employment at the beginning,&quot; Schieber said at a seminar in Madrid.</p>
</text>
